updated_at":"2026-09-08T21:53:09Z"},{"id":551388715,"node_id":"RA_kwDOP5rK3s4g3YYr","name":"resterm_Windows_x86_64.exe.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":93,"digest":"sha256:cbeb64cf2f94104f52274db1505e6db1290cb045766764018064dc0e764f9179","download_count":20,"created_at":"2026-09-08T21:53:06Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T21:53:07Z"}],"body":"## v1.7.2\r\n\r\nA quick release that saves a few MB on disk. Reworked code and trimmed imports make the Resterm binary ~22% smaller.\r\n\r\nSee today's earlier releases for the other changes:\r\n\r\n- [1.7.0 release notes](https://github.com/unkn0wn-root/resterm/releases/tag/v1.7.0) for editor diagnostics, Unicode editing fixes, and the updated response split shortcuts.\r\n- [1.7.1 release notes](https://github.com/unkn0wn-root/resterm/releases/tag/v1.7.1) for fixes to invisible characters breaking TUI rendering and improvements to command hints.\r\n\r\n## Smaller binary\r\n\r\n- Removed unused syntax highlighters while keeping the formats Resterm already supports.\r\n- Reduced the Kubernetes API code included for port-forwarding.\r\n\r\nOn macOS with Apple silicon, the binary is about **23% smaller** than in 1.7.1, dropping from **80.6 MiB to 62.1 MiB**. The exact reduction depends on the platform.\r\n\r\nSyntax highlighting and Kubernetes port-forwarding keep their existing behavior. You can update without changing your configuration.\r\n"}
